  nonce: bff5  # bff5
  message: "PREMISE CHECK 2026-10-29 (dev 4401fbfa30). Not stale: no ADR written yet, ADR-0062 is still free (docs/adr tops out at 0061), the three isbefore items (WI-lakid, WI-rudat, WI-vojil) are all todo_hard P4 and untouched. The six decisions stand. Description corrected in place:\n\n1. WI-hopip is DONE (PR #1751, 2026-10-20), so decision 6 no longer waits on it. Its fix changes what a Yjs route on serve means: create_app(authenticate=...) denies every route but /health and static by default, enforced by test_serve_auth_gate.py enumerating routes. WI-sunan is still todo_hard.\n2. NEW CONSTRAINT on decision 5's \"WebSocket on htrac serve\" option: serve.py run_server does `app = create_app()` -- no TrackerSet, no authenticator. So production serve serves no tracker, its watchfiles loop / state_snapshot broadcast do not run (serve.py:20 -- only when a TrackerSet is wired), and a route added there would 401. Wiring is WI-pupod, which the owner has deferred indefinitely; recorded as a dependency, not raised.\n3. Versions re-checked: pycrdt 0.14.10 (2026-10-19; item said 0.14.9); y-py 0.6.2 last released 2023-10-05; yjs latest 13.6.33 (2026-09-23), v14 still pre-release (yjs@14.0.0-16 beta 2025-12-07; @y/y 14.0.0-rc.29 beta).\n4. ADR-0019 was amended 2026-10-17 (item said re-scoped 10-16). It already names ADR-0062 / WI-tofog as the frontend and already contains \"Why not BlockSuite (re-decided 2026-10-17)\", so the done-when no longer asks ADR-0062 to restate it.\n5. store.py op kinds: added discuss_clear, which the input list omitted.\nUnchanged and verified: INV-hivog (two-user mode) is pending_validation; ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/notebookjournal_10162026_2318.md exists.\nNot checked: the codeberg pf-prelim spec sections cited (not on ALLOWED_WEBSITES.md); the local ~/plazaflow/spec.md was not compared against them."  # bff5
